{
  "declaredLength": 4872,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "삐햐!?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C090D5900021003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "왜 그래, 후파?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨가\n뭔가 흥미로운 거라도 가지고 있어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C65C0020ADF8B798002C0020D6C4D30C003F00100001BE01000A00100002010000000020C528AC00000ABB54AC000020D765BBF8B85CC6B40020AC70B77CB3C40020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C5B4003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어라...\n그 사탕은 뭐죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B77C002E002E002E000AADF80020C0ACD0D5C7400020BB50C8E0003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "톡톡캔디야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D1A1D1A1CE94B514C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹어 볼래?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39C5B40020BCFCB798003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "입안에서 톡톡 터지는 캔디라니...\n조금 무섭긴 하지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n배움을 위해 먹어 보는 것도 괜찮겠네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C785C548C5D0C11C0020D1A1D1A10020D130C9C0B2940020CE94B514B77CB2C8002E002E002E000AC870AE080020BB34C12DAE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C00100001BE00000ABC30C6C0C7440020C704D5740020BA39C5B40020BCF4B2940020AC83B3C40020AD1CCC2EACA0B124C694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금만 먹어 볼게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE08B9CC0020BA39C5B40020BCFCAC8CC694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640C544002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멋진 도넛을 만들 수 있을 것 같아요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4BC9C40020B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C544C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n잠깐만 기다려 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000AC7A0AE50B9CC0020AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "새로운 도넛을 위한\n레시피가 완성됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C8B85CC6B40020B3C4B11BC7440020C704D55C000AB808C2DCD53CAC000020C644C131B410C5B4C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스위트 40, 스파이시 200, 사워 400,\n비터 280, 프레시 40 이상이 되도록<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n준비해 주시면 돼요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4C704D2B8002000340030002C0020C2A4D30CC774C2DC0020003200300030002C0020C0ACC6CC0020003400300030002C000ABE44D1300020003200380030002C0020D504B808C2DC0020003400300020C774C0C1C7740020B418B3C4B85D00100001BE00000AC900BE44D5740020C8FCC2DCBA740020B3FCC694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "새로운 도넛을 만들어 보실 거면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C8B85CC6B40020B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4C2E40020AC70BA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "톡톡캔디에서 아이디어를 얻어서 만든\n자극적인 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>플라스마 딥<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이 완성됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D1A1D1A1CE94B514C5D0C11C0020C544C774B514C5B4B97C0020C5BBC5B4C11C0020B9CCB4E0000AC790ADF9C801C778002000100002FF000006D50CB77CC2A4B9C80020B52500100002FF000000C7740020C644C131B410C5B4C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후파에게 먹이면\n어떤 이차원 미르로 가게 될까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D30CC5D0AC8C0020BA39C774BA74000AC5B4B5A40020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974B85C0020AC00AC8C0020B420AE4CC694003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금 바로\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>미르역 앞<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>으로 와 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE080020BC14B85C000A00100002FF000006BBF8B974C5ED0020C55E00100002FF000000C73CB85C0020C6400020C918002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또 큰 사건이 일어나려는 걸까요?\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨라면 괜찮을 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B6100020D0700020C0ACAC74C7740020C77CC5B4B098B824B2940020AC78AE4CC694003F000A00100002010000000020C528B77CBA740020AD1CCC2EC7440020AC70C608C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저길 봐 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE380020BD100020BD10002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 저런\n이차원의 뒤틀림은 본 적 없지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B3C40020C800B7F0000AC774CC28C6D0C7580020B4A4D2C0B9BCC7400020BCF80020C8010020C5C6C9C0003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "처음 봐요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC98C74C0020BD10C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "노란색이네요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B178B780C0C9C774B124C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안에 어떤 포켓몬이 있을지 알 수 없어서\n너를 부른 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C5D00020C5B4B5A40020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788C744C9C00020C54C0020C2180020C5C6C5B4C11C000AB108B97C0020BD80B9780020AC70C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁 좀 하지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C10020C8800020D558C9C0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어마어마한 뒤틀림이 발견됐어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n안에는 분명 위험한 포켓몬이 있을 거야.\n폭주 메가진화라도 하면 큰일이니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n너희 3인조가 조사해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가스톤 아가씨와 리더에게는\n내 쪽에서 연락해 둘게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C2A4D1A40020C544AC00C528C6400020B9ACB354C5D0AC8CB294000AB0B40020CABDC5D0C11C0020C5F0B77DD5740020B458AC8C002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 위치는 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>미르역 앞<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC38ACE0B85C0020C704CE58B294002000100002FF000006BBF8B974C5ED0020C55E00100002FF000000C774C57C002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이미 도착해 있어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BBF80020B3C4CC29D5740020C788C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "위치는 이미 확인했어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C704CE58B2940020C774BBF80020D655C778D588C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "넌 정말 재미있는 녀석이라니까!\n그럼, 부탁한다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B10C0020C815B9D00020C7ACBBF8C788B2940020B140C11DC774B77CB2C8AE4C0021000AADF8B7FC002C0020BD80D0C1D55CB2E4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨 말이야,\n시장 같은 걸 해도 잘할 것 같지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C5280020B9D0C774C57C002C000AC2DCC7A50020AC19C7400020AC780020D574B3C40020C798D5600020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC544003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코르니 납시오!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54B974B2C80020B0A9C2DCC624002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 당분간 오기 힘들 것 같대.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000A00100002018B000100100002190000010020B2F9BD84AC040020C624AE300020D798B4E40020AC830020AC19B300002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니까 조사는\n우리 둘이서만 해야 할 것 같아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020C870C0ACB294000AC6B0B9AC0020B458C774C11CB9CC0020D574C57C0020D5600020AC830020AC19C544002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대역은 제가 맡을게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300C5EDC7400020C81CAC000020B9E1C744AC8CC694002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마티에르 씨시죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528C2DCC8E0003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네, 메가도넛 대작전을 하기 전에\n이차원 미르에서 만났었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124002C0020BA54AC00B3C4B11B0020B300C791C804C7440020D558AE300020C804C5D0000AC774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0C11C0020B9CCB0ACC5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마티에르 씨도\n상당한 실력의 메가진화술사라고 들었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528B3C4000AC0C1B2F9D55C0020C2E4B825C7580020BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACB77CACE00020B4E4C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 이번에는\n우리 셋이서 조사해 봐요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C774BC88C5D0B294000AC6B0B9AC0020C14BC774C11C0020C870C0ACD5740020BD10C694002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n준비가 되면 내게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AC900BE44AC000020B418BA740020B0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "들어갈 준비는 됐어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E4C5B4AC080020C900BE44B2940020B410C5B4003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "들어간다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E4C5B4AC04B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제 막 결성된 트리오니까\n철저히 준비해 두는 게 좋을 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81C0020B9C90020ACB0C131B41C0020D2B8B9ACC624B2C8AE4C000ACCA0C800D7880020C900BE44D5740020B450B2940020AC8C0020C88BC7440020AC70C57C002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 언제든지 출발해도 돼!\n미르의 평화를 지키기 위한 일이니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020C5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020CD9CBC1CD574B3C40020B3FC0021000ABBF8B974C7580020D3C9D654B97C0020C9C0D0A4AE300020C704D55C0020C77CC774B2C8AE4C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐만, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n박스가 가득 찬 상태로는\n안에 있는 포켓몬을 잡을 수 없어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE50B9CC002C00200010000201000000002100100001BE01000ABC15C2A4AC000020AC00B4DD0020CC2C0020C0C1D0DCB85CB294000AC548C5D00020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C7A1C7440020C2180020C5C6C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 탐정으로서의 감이 말하고 있어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n특별한 이차원 미르에 가려면\n특별한 도넛이 필요하다고 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D0D0C815C73CB85CC11CC7580020AC10C7740020B9D0D558ACE00020C788C5B4002E00100001BE01000AD2B9BCC4D55C0020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D00020AC00B824BA74000AD2B9BCC4D55C0020B3C4B11BC7740020D544C694D558B2E4ACE00020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제라오라!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CB77CC624B77C0021003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "최강의 전기포켓몬...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n폭주 메가진화라도 하면 어떻게 될지\n도저히 상상이 안 가!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CAC15C7580020C804AE30D3ECCF13BAAC002E002E002E00100001BE01000AD3EDC8FC0020BA54AC00C9C4D654B77CB3C40020D558BA740020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020B420C9C0000AB3C4C800D7880020C0C1C0C1C7740020C5480020AC00002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코르니 씨 정도 되는 트레이너도\n위협을 느낄 때가 있군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54B974B2C80020C5280020C815B3C40020B418B2940020D2B8B808C774B108B3C4000AC704D611C7440020B290B0840020B54CAC000020C788AD70C694002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니요, 그 반대예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8C694002C0020ADF80020BC18B300C608C694002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강적과 싸워 볼 수 있다는 사실에\n감격하고 있는 거라구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15C801ACFC0020C2F8C6CC0020BCFC0020C2180020C788B2E4B2940020C0ACC2E4C5D0000AAC10ACA9D558ACE00020C788B2940020AC70B77CAD6CC694002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 폭주 메가진화의 고통으로부터\n해방시켜 주도록 해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020D3EDC8FC0020BA54AC00C9C4D654C7580020ACE0D1B5C73CB85CBD80D130000AD574BC29C2DCCF1C0020C8FCB3C4B85D0020D574C694002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "주위의 메가파워 농도가 급상승 중!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n경고! 현재 확인 중인 개체에\n폭주 메가진화가 발생합니다!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8FCC704C7580020BA54AC00D30CC6CC0020B18DB3C4AC000020AE09C0C1C2B90020C911002100100001BE01000AACBDACE000210020D604C7AC0020D655C7780020C911C7780020AC1CCCB4C5D0000AD3EDC8FC0020BA54AC00C9C4D654AC000020BC1CC0DDD569B2C8B2E4002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그오오아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8C624C624C54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n제라오라를 잡아 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AC81CB77CC624B77CB97C0020C7A1C5440020C918002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제라오라...\n정말 말도 안 되게 강했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CB77CC624B77C002E002E002E000AC815B9D00020B9D0B3C40020C5480020B418AC8C0020AC15D588C5B4002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제라오라는 싸울 상대를 찾으려는 듯이\n가끔씩 사람이 사는 마을에 나타나서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n보디가드를 자처할 때가 있다고 들었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CB77CC624B77CB2940020C2F8C6B80020C0C1B300B97C0020CC3EC73CB824B2940020B4EFC774000AAC00B054C5290020C0ACB78CC7740020C0ACB2940020B9C8C744C5D00020B098D0C0B098C11C00100001BE00000ABCF4B514AC00B4DCB97C0020C790CC98D5600020B54CAC000020C788B2E4ACE00020B4E4C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강해지고 싶다는 마음에서\n이런 이차원 미르가 생긴 걸지도 모르겠네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D574C9C0ACE00020C2F6B2E4B2940020B9C8C74CC5D0C11C000AC774B7F00020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974AC000020C0DDAE340020AC78C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0B124C694002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 우리의 미르로 돌아가 볼까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C6B0B9ACC7580020BBF8B974B85C0020B3CCC544AC000020BCFCAE4C003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004> 코르니 씨는\n이런 식으로 미르를 지켜 온 거구나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000040020CF54B974B2C80020C528B294000AC774B7F00020C2DDC73CB85C0020BBF8B974B97C0020C9C0CF1C0020C6280020AC70AD6CB098002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 수고 많으셨어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020C218ACE00020B9CEC73CC168C5B4C694002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저야말로 도와주셔서 고마웠어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n마티에르 씨가 없었더라면\n제라오라를 진정시킬 수 없었을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C57CB9D0B85C0020B3C4C640C8FCC154C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6E0C5B4C694002100100001BE01000AB9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528AC000020C5C6C5C8B354B77CBA74000AC81CB77CC624B77CB97C0020C9C4C815C2DCD0AC0020C2180020C5C6C5C8C7440020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "늦어서 미안!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2A6C5B4C11C0020BBF8C548002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다리게 해서 미안!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B9ACAC8C0020D574C11C0020BBF8C548002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이미 끝났거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 4596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BBF80020B05DB0ACAC70B4E0002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네?\n앗, 마티에르 씨...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 4624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F000AC557002C0020B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528002E002E002E003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네?\n앗, 마티에르 씨...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F000AC557002C0020B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528002E002E002E003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대신 이차원 미르에서\n열심히 싸우고 왔어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300C2E00020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0C11C000AC5F4C2ECD7880020C2F8C6B0ACE00020C654C5B4002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제부터는 이렇게 셋이\n미르 최강의 트리오라구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81CBD80D130B2940020C774B807AC8C0020C14BC774000ABBF8B9740020CD5CAC15C7580020D2B8B9ACC624B77CAD6C002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에엥~!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 4832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5D0C5E5007E0021003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에엥~!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
